		sections={
			{id=17095,title="Overview",body="Rixxa Fluxflame will spray |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259022|h[Azerite Catalyst]|h|r at players, which will leave behind patches of the toxic substance. Rixxa will push patches of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259022|h[Azerite Catalyst]|h|r away from her when she targets players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259940|h[Propellant Blast]|h|r."},
			{id=17096,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Be mindful of where Rixxa places her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259022|h[Azerite Catalyst]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid being pushed into |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259022|h[Azerite Catalyst]|h|r by Rixxa's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259940|h[Propellant Blast]|h|r."},
			{id=17097,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Be mindful of where Rixxa places her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259022|h[Azerite Catalyst]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid being pushed into |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259022|h[Azerite Catalyst]|h|r by Rixxa's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259940|h[Propellant Blast]|h|r."},
			{id=17098,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Maneuver Rixxa away from patches of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259022|h[Azerite Catalyst]|h|r.\n$bullet;Be mindful of where Rixxa places her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259022|h[Azerite Catalyst]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid being pushed into |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259022|h[Azerite Catalyst]|h|r by Rixxa's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259940|h[Propellant Blast]|h|r."},
