			{itemID=159270,diffs={1,2,23},faction=-1},
			{itemID=159410,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=17475,title="Overview",body="|cFF2959D3|Hspell:259830|h[Boundless Rot]|h|r summons spore pods throughout the area. Upon reacing 100 Energy, Zancha casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259732|h[Festering Harvest]|h|r destroying any remaining spore pods and applying the effects of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:273226|h[Decaying Spores]|h|r to all players."},
			{id=17476,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259714|h[Rotting Spores]|h|r inflicts direct damage and significant damage over time.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259718|h[Upheaval] |h|r inflicts substantial damage."},
			{id=17477,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Position Zancha so that he strikes spore pods with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:272457|h[Shockwave]|h|r."},
			{id=17478,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Utilize |cFF2959D3|Hspell:259718|h[Upheaval] |h|rto safely destroy spore pods while avoiding your allies. \n$bullet;Destroy additional spore pods using defensive abilities if neccesary."},
