			{itemID=278982,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168131,diffs={1,101,24},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=17853,title="Overview",body="Essence Defilers arrive to channel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301199|h[Defiling Taint]|h|r upon the Avatar of Sethraliss until their defeat. As part of their assault, Corrupted Guardians appear whose |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300871|h[Corrupted Lifeforce]|h|r can be cleansed to heal the Avatar. Upon removal of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301199|h[Defiling Taint]|h|r, Faithless Tormentors fixate on the party's healer and attempt to strike them with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300714|h[Shadowlash]|h|r. The battle ends once players fully restore the Avatar."},
			{id=17854,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Defeating all Essence Defilers cleanses the Avatar of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301199|h[Defiling Taint]|h|r.\n$bullet;The Avatar consumes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300871|h[Corrupted Lifeforce]|h|r from Corrupted Guardians once purified.\n$bullet;After damaging Faithless Tormentors, the Avatar |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1302296|h[Siphons the Weak]|h|r."},
			{id=17855,title="Healers",body="$bullet;The battle ends in victory once the Avatar reaches full health.\n$bullet;Essence Defilers' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301199|h[Defiling Taint]|h|r and Faithless Tormentors' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300714|h[Shadowlash]|h|r thwart healing.\n$bullet;The Avatar consumes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300871|h[Corrupted Lifeforce]|h|r from Corrupted Guardians once purified."},
			{id=17856,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Corrupted Guardians inflict significant Physical and Shadow damage with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300803|h[Tainted Strike]|h|r.\n$bullet;The Avatar consumes |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300871|h[Corrupted Lifeforce]|h|r from Corrupted Guardians once purified.\n$bullet;Essence Defilers' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1301199|h[Defiling Taint]|h|r and Faithless Tormentors' |cFF2959D3|Hspell:1300714|h[Shadowlash]|h|r thwart healing."},
			{id=37180,title="Stage One: Defiler's Corruption",body="Jakra'zet's allies arrive to prevent healing energy from reaching the Avatar."},
			{id=18205,title="Corrupted Guardian"},
			{id=37276,title="Section 29"},
			{id=37097,title="Section 14",difficultyIDs={1,2,19,24,150,205,216,236}},
