			{itemID=206199,diffs={8},faction=-1},
			{itemID=206197,diffs={8},faction=-1},
			{itemID=206198,diffs={8},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=17915,title="Overview",body="The Unbound Abomination is protected by a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:269185|h[Blood Barrier]|h|r that absorbs all damage taken. As damage is absorbed, the abomination overflows with Blood Energy. Upon reaching 100 Blood Energy, several Blood Visages erupt from the abomination. Each Blood Visage shares a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:269692|h[Fatal Link]|h|r with the abomination that damages it when they die."},
			{id=17916,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:269301|h[Putrid Blood]|h|r will quickly overrun the party if not dispelled."},
			{id=17917,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Several Blood Visages spawn when the Unbound Abomination reaches 100 Blood Energy."},
			{id=17918,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; The Unbound Abomination can only be damaged by killing Blood Visages.\n$bullet; Titan Keeper Hezrel will aid players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:269310|h[Cleansing Light]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:269406|h[Purge Corruption]|h|r"},
			{id=17976,title="Ability"},
			{id=18312,title="Blood Visage"},
			{id=18313,title="Section 7"},
			{id=18314,title="Section 8"},
			{id=18315,title="Section 9"},
			{id=18913,title="Section 14",difficultyIDs={2,8,23}},
			{id=18316,title="Titan Keeper Hezrel",body="Titan keeper Hezrel fights to stop the Unbound Abomination."},
			{id=18317,title="Section 11"},
			{id=18318,title="Section 12"},
			{id=18319,title="Section 13"},
		},
	},
	[2165]={
		encounterID=2165,
		instanceID=1041,
		order=1,
		name="The Golden Serpent",
		lore="Kings' Rest has come under attack before. After a foolish troll tried to summon Hakkar the Soulflayer to this island many millennia ago, the priests of Zandalar created a mighty construct to defend this tomb. The Golden Serpent has stood against intruders ever since, judging who is worthy to enter these sacred halls.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2139,
		uiMapID=1004,
		pin={x=0.8072,y=0.686},
		difficultyIDs={2,8,23,24},
		npcIDs={135322},
		displayIDs={84202},
		loot={
			{itemID=159137,diffs={2,23,24},faction=-1},
			{itemID=159234,diffs={2,23,24},faction=-1},
			{itemID=159413,diffs={2,23,24},faction=-1},
			{itemID=159304,diffs={2,23,24},faction=-1},
			{itemID=159617,diffs={2,23,24},faction=-1},
			{itemID=159369,diffs={2,23,24},faction=-1},
			{itemID=159412,diffs={2,23,24},faction=-1},
			{itemID=159313,diffs={2,23,24},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168168,diffs={104,24},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=17989,title="Overview",body="The Golden Serpent spits gold at party members, who then leave it behind in the form of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265914|h[Molten Gold]|h|r. The Golden Serpent later animates these pools with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265923|h[Lucre's Call]|h|r. Any Animated Gold that reaches The Golden Serpent is absorbed, granting a stack of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265991|h[Luster]|h|r that shields the Serpent and increases its damage."},
			{id=17990,title="Tank",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:265910|h[Tail Thrash]|h|r inflicts Physical damage to the current target player.\n$bullet;Each stack of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265991|h[Luster]|h|r shields The Golden Serpent and increases its damage."},
			{id=17991,title="Healer",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:265773|h[Spit Gold]|h|r inflicts Fire damage over time to the afflicted player and leaves a pool of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265914|h[Molten Gold]|h|r at their location.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:1311987|h[Serpentine Gust]|h|r inflicts damage to all  players."},
			{id=17992,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:265923|h[Lucre's Call]|h|r turns all pools of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265914|h[Molten Gold]|h|r into Animated Gold, which move toward The Golden Serpent.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:265773|h[Spit Gold]|h|r inflicts Fire damage over time to the afflicted player and leaves a pool of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265914|h[Molten Gold]|h|r at their location."},
			{id=17993,title="Section 5",difficultyIDs={2,23,24}},
			{id=17994,title="Section 6",difficultyIDs={2,23,24}},
			{id=17995,title="Section 7",difficultyIDs={2,23,24}},
			{id=17996,title="Animated Gold",body="Attempts to move towards The Golden Serpent. If any reach it, The Golden Serpent absorbs them and gains a stack of Luster. When any Animated Gold are killed, they return to pools of Molten Gold.",difficultyIDs={2,23,24}},
			{id=17997,title="Section 9",difficultyIDs={2,23,24}},
			{id=17998,title="Section 10",difficultyIDs={2,23,24}},
			{id=17999,title="Section 11",difficultyIDs={2,23,24}},
			{id=18859,title="Heroic and Mythic Difficulty Only",body="Kings' Rest is not available in Normal Difficulty.",difficultyIDs={1}},
		},
	},
	[2166]={
		encounterID=2166,
		instanceID=1031,
		order=4,
		name="Vectis",
		lore="The plague of corrupted blood killed countless trolls and began one of the most terrifying periods in Zandalar's history. The constructs within Uldir studied the disease in search of a cure, but found that only isolation and extermination was effective. Unfortunately, as the facility's safeguards cracked apart, the plague was accidentally combined with a sample of G'huun's blood, creating a new entity that hungered for fresh victims.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2134,
		uiMapID=1152,
		pin={x=0.5255,y=0.3083},
		difficultyIDs={14,15,16,17},
		npcIDs={134442},
		displayIDs={85116},
		loot={
			{itemID=160698,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160623,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160636,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160678,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160734,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160649,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160621,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160644,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160715,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160716,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=160655,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=18933,title="Overview",body="$[14, 15, 17Vectis creates instances of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r which bounce endlessly between players during the encounter. When |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r jumps between players it leaves behind a stack of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265127|h[Lingering Infection]|h|r, which has no duration and cannot be removed. Vectis will create multiple instances of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r at the beginning of the encounter.$]$[16Vectis creates instances of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r which bounce endlessly between players during the encounter. When |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r jumps between players it leaves behind a stack of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265127|h[Lingering Infection]|h|r, which has no duration and cannot be removed. Vectis will create multiple instances of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r at the beginning of the encounter.\n\n|cFF2959D3|Hspell:267242|h[Contagion]|h|r will trigger additional effects based on the number of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265127|h[Lingering Infection]|h|r stacks each player has.$]",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=18934,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Avoid taking |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r from your allies, as |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265127|h[Lingering Infection]|h|r will increase damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265178|h[Evolving Affliction]|h|r."},
			{id=18935,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Targets afflicted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265212|h[Gestate]|h|r will require heavy healing to survive.\n$bullet;Communicate with your allies to control hosts for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r.\n$bullet;Areas targeted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:266948|h[Plague Bomb]|h|r that detonate without players inside them will spawn an addtional Plague Amalgam."},
			{id=18936,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Kill Plague Amalgams quickly to prevent excessive healing absorption from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265206|h[Immunosuppression]|h|r.\n$bullet;Areas targeted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:266948|h[Plague Bomb]|h|r that detonate without players inside them will spawn an addtional Plague Amalgam.\n$bullet;Avoid the area damage from targets affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265212|h[Gestate]|h|r.\n$bullet;Communicate with your allies to control hosts for |cFF2959D3|Hspell:265129|h[Omega Vector]|h|r."},
			{id=18004,title="Section 6"},
			{id=18005,title="Section 5",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=18626,title="Section 16",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=18627,title="Section 16",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=18642,title="Engorged Parasite",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=18644,title="Section 20",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=18717,title="Section 21",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=18628,title="Section 16",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=18625,title="Section 5",difficultyIDs={14,15,17}},
			{id=18846,title="Stage One: Probing its Hosts"},
			{id=18006,title="Section 7"},
			{id=18054,title="Section 16"},
			{id=18017,title="Section 14"},
			{id=18007,title="Plague Amalgam"},
			{id=18008,title="Section 9"},
			{id=18847,title="Stage Two: Spreading Pandemic"},
