			{itemID=160637,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=163119,diffs={109},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=18018,title="Overview",body="Taloc's blood-fueled magic will flood the room with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:270290|h[Blood Storms]|h|r. His powerful |cFF2959D3|Hspell:271296|h[Cudgel of Gore]|h|r will absorb nearby |cFF2959D3|Hspell:270290|h[Blood Storms]|h|r.\n\nAt 35% health, Taloc's fuel spills into the arena causing him to |cFF2959D3|Hspell:271965|h[Power Down]|h|r and spawn Coalesced Blood and Volatile Droplets.\n\nVolatile Droplets will continue to spawn once Taloc reabsorbs his fuel, canceling |cFF2959D3|Hspell:271965|h[Powered Down]|h|r and engaging the raid once more."},
			{id=18019,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Aim the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:271296|h[Cudgel of Gore]|h|r to clear away |cFF2959D3|Hspell:270290|h[Blood Storms]|h|r.\n$bullet;Taunt Coalesced Bloods while Taloc is disabled to keep them away from your allies."},
			{id=18020,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Allies will take significant damage when afflicted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:271222|h[Plasma Discharge]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid standing close to an ally targeted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:271296|h[Cudgel of Gore]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid standing in front of Taloc when he casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:272582|h[Sanguine Static]|h|r."},
			{id=18021,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Avoid standing close to an ally targeted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:271296|h[Cudgel of Gore]|h|r.\n$bullet;Defeat Volatile Droplets before they can reach an ally and inflict |cFF2959D3|Hspell:272584|h[Combustible Fuel]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid standing in front of Taloc when he casts |cFF2959D3|Hspell:272582|h[Sanguine Static]|h|r."},
			{id=18434,title="Stage One: The Corrupted Construct"},
			{id=18326,title="Section 7"},
			{id=18657,title="Section 6"},
			{id=18429,title="Section 7"},
