			{itemID=166794,diffs={14},faction=-3},
			{itemID=166795,diffs={14},faction=-3},
		},
		sections={
			{id=18991,title="Overview",body="Ivus the Forest Lord often uses abilities to attack several players at random and will retreat to the safety of his |cFF2959D3|Hspell:282615|h[Petrified Bark]|h|r when at low health."},
			{id=18992,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Ivus will cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:282404|h[Frost Breath]|h|r in your direction, leaving a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:282414|h[Frost Patch]|h|r on the ground beneath you.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:282487|h[Lunar Strike]|h|r will leave a few clear areas on initial impact before spreading.\n$bullet;Wisps summoned while Ivus is |cFF2959D3|Hspell:282615|h[Petrified]|h|r fixate on players at random and cannot be controlled through threat generation."},
			{id=18993,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:282431|h[Hurl Boulder]|h|r will hit players at random.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:282487|h[Lunar Strike]|h|r will leave a few clear areas on initial impact before spreading.\n$bullet;Wisps will channel |cFF2959D3|Hspell:282622|h[Ancient Spark]|h|r on a random player until they are dispatched."},
			{id=18994,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:282431|h[Hurl Boulder]|h|r hits players at random.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:282487|h[Lunar Strike]|h|r will leave a few clear areas on initial impact before spreading.\n$bullet;Ivus will remain immune to damage while |cFF2959D3|Hspell:282615|h[Petrified]|h|r. Dispatch all active Wisps to make Ivus end the Petrification."},
			{id=18995,title="Section 5"},
			{id=18996,title="Section 6"},
			{id=19834,title="Section 12"},
			{id=18997,title="Section 7"},
			{id=18998,title="Section 8"},
			{id=18999,title="Section 9"},
			{id=19000,title="Wisp"},
			{id=19001,title="Section 11"},
		},
	},
	[2330]={
