		sections={
			{id=19041,title="Overview",body="King Mechagon, a master inventor, unleashes two of his greatest contraptions. Initially, he begins his assault by piloting the Aerial Unit R-21/X.  Once destroyed, King Mechagon unleashes his greatest weapon, the Omega Buster mech suit."},
			{id=19042,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Avoid touching |cFF2959D3|Hspell:291915|h[Plasma Orbs]|h|r.\n$bullet;Position yourself to avoid hitting other players with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:291928|h[Giga-Zap]|h|r."},
