		sections={
			{id=19384,title="Overview",body="Players face off against a pair of Alliance combatants who combine their powers at key points throughout the fight."},
			{id=19385,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Keep both combatant's health at similar levels to avoid giving either combatant too much damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:286487|h[Harmonious Spirits]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:284374|h[Magma Trap]|h|r will knock you so high into the air that the fall will kill you.\n$bullet;Spirits of Xuen will |cFF2959D3|Hspell:285632|h[Stalk]|h|r a random target until they are defeated.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:286425|h[Fire Shield]|h|r must be damaged down so that you can interrupt |cFF2959D3|Hspell:286379|h[Pyroblast]|h|r.\n$bullet;During Serene Showers, you are unable to pass through |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284146|h[Rings of Hostility]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:284453|h[Chi-Ji's Song]|h|r blocks targeting into and out of its confines.",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=19386,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Keep both combatant's health at similar levels to avoid giving either combatant too much damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:286487|h[Harmonious Spirits]|h|r.\n$bullet;During Hostile Showers, you are unable to pass through |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284146|h[Rings of Hostility]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:286425|h[Fire Shield]|h|r must be damaged down so that you can interrupt |cFF2959D3|Hspell:286379|h[Pyroblast]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:284453|h[Chi-Ji's Song]|h|r blocks targeting into and out of its confines.",difficultyIDs={14,17}},
			{id=19387,title="Healers",body="$bullet;You cannot heal the tank while they are going through their |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284028|h[Multi-Sided Strike]|h|r sequence.\n$bullet;Dispel the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:286988|h[Searing Embers]|h|r with the lowest duration remaining first to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:286989|h[Unleashed Ember]|h|r.\n$bullet;Players inside |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284453|h[Chi-Ji's Song]|h|r will be obscured from your sight unless you step inside with them.\n$bullet;Once |cFF2959D3|Hspell:282040|h[Blazing Phoenix]|h|r is active, the entire raid will continually take damage until the Blazing Phoenix is dispatched.",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=19388,title="Healers",body="$bullet;You cannot heal the tank while they are going through their |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284028|h[Multi-Sided Strike]|h|r sequence.\n$bullet;Dispel the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:286988|h[Searing Embers]|h|r with the lowest duration remaining first to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:286989|h[Unleashed Ember]|h|r.\n$bullet;Players inside |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284453|h[Chi-Ji's Song]|h|r will be obscured from your sight unless you step inside with them.\n$bullet;Once |cFF2959D3|Hspell:282040|h[Blazing Phoenix]|h|r is active, the entire raid will continually take damage until the Blazing Phoenix is dispatched.",difficultyIDs={14,17}},
			{id=19389,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;You're on your own during |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284028|h[Multi-Sided Strike]|h|r, face each attack to mitigate the damage!\n$bullet;You must work with your fellow tank to manage each other's applications of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:282037|h[Rising Flames]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:286436|h[Whirling Jade Storm]|h|r persists until the caster is engaged in melee combat.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:284453|h[Chi-Ji's Song]|h|r blocks targeting into and out of its confines."},
			{id=19390,title="Mestrah, the Illuminated",body="Monk who uses her powers of Storm, Earth, and Fire to attack the players with devastating attacks."},
			{id=19935,title="Section 29"},
			{id=19391,title="Section 5"},
			{id=19392,title="Section 14",body="$[!14\n\nIn Normal Difficulty, three strikes occur.$]$[!15\n\nIn Heroic Difficulty, four strikes occur.  Once Mestrah, the Illuminated assumes her dragon form, nearly all players face their own Multi-sided Strike challenge$]$[!16\n\nIn Mythic Difficulty, five strikes occur, and nearly all players face their own Multi-Sided Strike challenge.$]$[!17\n\nIn Looking for Raid Difficulty, three strikes occur.$]"},
			{id=19612,title="Section 38"},
			{id=19615,title="Section 39"},
			{id=19393,title="Section 27",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=19417,title="Tiger Paw",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=19418,title="Section 31",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=19394,title="Manceroy Flamefist",body="Fire Mage who uses the power of fire to attack his enemies."},
			{id=19395,title="Section 8"},
			{id=19397,title="Section 30"},
			{id=19398,body="$[!16\n\nIn Mythic difficulty, this ability instantly kills the victim.$]"},
			{id=19607,title="Section 36"},
			{id=19399,title="Section 35"},
			{id=19493,title="Section 34"},
			{id=19400,title="Section 36",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=19401,title="Team Attacks"},
			{id=19402,title="Combined Power"},
			{id=19403,title="Fire from Mist",body="When the Combined Power of the combatants reaches 30 power, the duo teams up to summon Living Bombs shrouded in jade mist. Each bomb will continually blast all players with explosions. The mist prevents targeting into and out of the zone."},
			{id=19404,title="Jade Mist"},
			{id=19423,title="Living Bomb"},
			{id=19405,title="Section 17"},
			{id=19424,title="Section 33"},
			{id=19406,title="A Flash of Hostility",body="When the Combined Power of the combatants reaches 60 power, all players are ported to one side of the playspace while the combatants teleport away. Manceroy creates a barrier and continually calls down Phoenix Strikes to pelt the area while Mestrah creates a maze of Rings of Hostility to foil player's passage across the battlefield.\n\nThe combatants continually channel their abilities until players break down the barrier and interrupt them.\n$[!15\nIn Heroic Difficulty, only one of the barrier's weak points is attackable unless a player uses a Force Orb to make the other points attackable.$]$[!16\nIn Mythic Difficulty, none of the barrier's weak points are attackable until players use a Force Orb to make each weak point attackable.  Additionally, a Spirit of Niuzao will chase the players through the maze.$]"},
			{id=19407,title="Section 9"},
			{id=19408,title="Section 13"},
			{id=19604,title="Section 35",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=19409,title="The Serpent and the Phoenix",body="The Monk transforms into a Jade Serpent, and the Mage transforms into a Phoenix. The transformations persist until the encounter ends.\nThis ability is used when the combatants reach a combined power level of 100.\n$[!15\nIn Heroic difficulty, the dragon now triggers a Multi-Sided Strike on nearly all enemies.$]"},
			{id=19410,title="Section 26",body="$[!15,16\n\nIn Heroic and Mythic difficulties, the cone of fire leaves a trail on the ground that continually burns any player standing in it.$]"},
			{id=19609,title="Section 37",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=19411,title="Blazing Phoenix"},
			{id=19864,title="Section 41"},
			{id=19867,title="Section 42"},
			{id=19919,title="Section 43"},
		},
	},
	[2342]={
		encounterID=2342,
		instanceID=1176,
		order=3,
		name="Opulence",
		lore="Long ago, King Dazar had his golden treasury enchanted so that it would rise against anyone except its rightful owner. Many an unsuspecting thief has been slain by the very riches they coveted, serving as an important lesson to those who would steal from the throne.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2271,
		uiMapID=1353,
		pin={x=0.4221,y=0.5142},
		difficultyIDs={14,15,16,17},
		npcIDs={147564},
		displayIDs={89251},
		loot={
			{itemID=165818,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=165591,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=165538,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=165573,diffs={},faction=-1},
