		},
		sections={
			{id=19465,title="Overview",body="Ra'wani empowers herself with various seals, and releases those seals to improve her allies whenever she reaches 100 Energy. Additionally, Ra'wani and her allies work to reduce the size of the battlefield for their enemies, using both |cFF2959D3|Hspell:283579|h[Consecration]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:283587|h[Wave of Light]|h|r to do so. Crusader allies provide additional damage and crowd control for Ra'wani, while disciples heal wounded allies."},
			{id=19467,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:284469|h[Seal of Retribution]|h|r causes the boss's melee attacks to affect all players.\n$bullet;Avoid facing the crusader allies when they cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:283650|h[Blinding Faith]|h|r."},
			{id=19468,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Don't let |cFF2959D3|Hspell:283572|h[Sacred Blade]|h|r stack too high.\n$bullet;When tanking the adds, move them out of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:283579|h[Consecration]|h|r so they are not affected by its damage reduction.\n$bullet;Keep the adds moving to avoid them being hit by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:283587|h[Wave of Light]|h|r."},
			{id=19466,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Interrupt any heals you can to avoid enemies regaining too much health.\n$bullet;Avoid facing the crusader allies when they cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:283650|h[Blinding Faith]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid attacking the boss when they are affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284436|h[Seal of Reckoning]|h|r."},
			{id=19469,title="Section 27"},
			{id=19470,title="Section 5"},
			{id=19471,title="Section 7"},
			{id=19675,title="Section 31",difficultyIDs={15}},
			{id=19676,title="Section 32",difficultyIDs={15}},
			{id=19677,title="Section 31",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=19678,title="Section 32",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=19582,title="Section 28",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=19583,title="Section 29",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=19584,title="Section 30",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=19472,title="Crusader's Seals",body="At the beginning of the fight, Ra'wani Kanae will cast a seal upon herself, giving her additional abilities and causing her to gain Energy. At 100 Energy, she releases the seal, causing an additional effect."},
			{id=19473,title="Section 16"},
			{id=19474,title="Section 10",body="$[\n\nAt 100 energy, the seal is released, giving an ally Righteous Blessing."},
			{id=19475,title="Section 26"},
			{id=19476,title="Section 31"},
			{id=19477,title="Section 11"},
			{id=19478,title="Section 23",body="$[\n\nAt 100 energy, the seal is released, causing the wearer to cast |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284474|h[Judgment: Reckoning]|h|r."},
			{id=19479,title="Section 25"},
			{id=19480,title="Section 24"},
			{id=19481,title="Section 8"},
			{id=19482,title="Section 29",body="${\n\nRa'wani casts Avenging Wrath when she is below 30% health."},
			{id=19483,title="Forces of the Crusade"},
			{id=19484,title="Rezani Disciple"},
