			{id=19894,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Dispel allies who fail to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:285460|h[Discom-BOMB-ulator]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid touching |cFF2959D3|Hspell:284885|h[Self-Trimming Hedge]|h|r blades.\n$bullet;At 100 energy, the Head Machinist activates the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:285443|h[\"Hidden\" Flame Cannon]|h|r."},
