			{itemID=168335,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=169305,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168876,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168889,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=169358,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=20023,title="Overview",body="Lady Ashvane begins the encounter encased in a |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296650|h[Hardened Carapace]|h|r, absorbing all damage. When the carapace is destroyed, the Azerite crystals embedded into Lady Ashvane flare to life and she begins to gain energy.  Upon reaching 100 energy, she regenerates her |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296650|h[Hardened Carapace]|h|r."},
			{id=20024,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Coordinate with your allies to ensure no |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296688|h[Rippling Waves]|h|r reach Lady Ashvane.\n$bullet;Move Lady Ashvane away from patches of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296752|h[Cutting Coral]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid other players when targeted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297333|h[Briny Bubble]|h|r.\n$bullet;Coordinate with your allies to use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296944|h[Arcing Azerite]|h|r to destroy |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296555|h[Coral Growths]|h|r."},
			{id=20025,title="DPS",body="$bullet;Coordinate with your allies to ensure no |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296688|h[Rippling Waves]|h|r reach Lady Ashvane.\n$bullet;Avoid other players when targeted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297333|h[Briny Bubble]|h|r.\n$bullet;Coordinate with your allies to use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296944|h[Arcing Azerite]|h|r to destroy |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296555|h[Coral Growths]|h|r."},
			{id=20027,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:296688|h[Rippling Wave]|h|r inflicts heavy damage to all players in the raid.\n$bullet;Coordinate with your allies to ensure no |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296688|h[Rippling Waves]|h|r reach Lady Ashvane.\n$bullet;Avoid other players when targeted with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297333|h[Briny Bubble]|h|r.\n$bullet;Coordinate with your allies to use |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296944|h[Arcing Azerite]|h|r to destroy |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296555|h[Coral Growths]|h|r."},
			{id=20057,title="Stage 1: Hardened Carapace"},
			{id=20058,title="Section 6"},
			{id=20059,title="Section 7"},
			{id=20060,title="Section 8",body="$[!16\n\nOn Mythic difficulty, the Coral Growth furthest from Lady Ashvane creates an Empowered Rippling Wave.$]"},
			{id=20061,title="Section 9"},
