		sections={
			{id=20033,title="Overview",body="The HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit fires |cFF2959D3|Hspell:295536|h[Cannon Blast]|h|r at players while out of reach and calls in support from Mechagon City. The HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit tethers itself to an Overcharge Station when it's preparing to fire |cFF2959D3|Hspell:295939|h[Annihilation Ray]|h|r."},
			{id=20034,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Prepare for heavy damage intake when struck by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:295445|h[Wreck]|h|r.\n$bullet; Note the position of the HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit when it fires |cFF2959D3|Hspell:295536|h[Cannon Blast]|h|r.\n$bullet; Ascend the platforms and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296260|h[Hack]|h|r the Overcharge Station when the HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:295939|h[Annihilation Ray]|h|r."},
			{id=20035,title="Healers",body="$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:295445|h[Wreck]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:302274|h[Fulminating Zap]|h|r inflict heavy damage.\n$bullet; Utilizie crowd control abilities on Walkie Shockie X1 units and avoid being near them.\n$bullet; Ascend the platforms and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296260|h[Hack]|h|r the Overcharge Station when the HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:295939|h[Annihilation Ray]|h|r."},
			{id=20036,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Utilizie crowd control abilities on Walkie Shockie X1 units and avoid being near them.\n$bullet; The HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit takes massive damage while under the effect of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296080|h[Haywire]|h|r.\n$bullet; Ascend the platforms and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:296260|h[Hack]|h|r the Overcharge Station when the HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:295939|h[Annihilation Ray]|h|r."},
			{id=20037,title="Stage One: Fire at Will!",body="The HK-8 Aerial Oppression Unit assaults players trapped within a teleportation field."},
