			{itemID=168751,diffs={104},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168752,diffs={55399,104},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=20101,title="Overview",body="Gobbamak calls Troggs from nearby caves to swarm players. Upon reaching 100 energy, Gobbamak uses |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297254|h[Charged Smash]|h|r which applies |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297257|h[Electrical Charge]|h|r to all players struck. This allows players to temporarily power the hoard of devices in the area."},
			{id=20102,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Scrapbone Grunters attack players at random.\n$bullet; Position Gobbamak so that your allies can split |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297254|h[Charged Smash]|h|r with you.\n$bullet; Move near stolen tech with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297257|h[Electrical Charge]|h|r to power them."},
			{id=20103,title="Healers",body="$bullet; Help split the damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297254|h[Charged Smash]|h|r.\n$bullet; Move near stolen tech with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297257|h[Electrical Charge]|h|r to power them.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297261|h[Rumble]|h|r inflicts moderate damage to all party members."},
			{id=20104,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; Help split the damage of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297254|h[Charged Smash]|h|r.\n$bullet; Move near stolen tech with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297257|h[Electrical Charge]|h|r to power them.\n$bullet; Defeat Troggs to prevent your party from becoming overwhelmed."},
			{id=20105,title="King Gobbamak"},
