	[2359]={
		encounterID=2359,
		instanceID=1179,
		order=6,
		name="The Queen's Court",
		lore="For ten thousand years, the Queen's Court has never failed to enforce the word of Azshara. Now, the queen's most powerful servants stand ready to fulfill her final decree.",
		dungeonEncounterID=2311,
		uiMapID=1518,
		pin={x=0.3371,y=0.4795},
		difficultyIDs={14,15,16,17},
		npcIDs={152852,152853},
		displayIDs={91617,92223},
		loot={
			{itemID=169315,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168886,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168896,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168338,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168879,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168898,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168364,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168892,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168350,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168357,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168881,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=169316,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=168890,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=169694,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=20183,title="Overview",body="Each member of Queen Azshara's court represents a facet of the Nazjatar forces, with Silivaz represent the might of the oceans and Pashmar the mastery over storms and sky. While overseeing the fight, Queen Azshara will become bored, and issue a series of decrees, changing up the rules of engagement."},
			{id=20395,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Coordinate with your tanking partner to ensure |cFF2959D3|Hspell:299575|h[Commander's Fury]|h|r or |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301830|h[Pashmar's Touch]|h|r doesn't stack too high.\n$bullet;Move either boss out of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:300545|h[Mighty Rupture]|h|r.\n$bullet;Use personal cooldowns when affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297586|h[Suffering]|h|r."},
			{id=20396,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Queen Azshara's decree |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297564|h[Deferred Sentence]|h|r has your team taking damage throughout, with a potential huge spike at the end.\n$bullet;Anyone afflicted by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297586|h[Suffering]|h|r can not be healed for its duration.\n$bullet;Help split the damage from Silivaz's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:299914|h[Frenetic Charge]|h|r with the targeted player.\n$bullet;Positioning is important, especially during the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:303227|h[Form Ranks]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297656|h[Stand Alone]|h|r decrees."},
			{id=20397,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Help split the damage from Silivaz's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:299914|h[Frenetic Charge]|h|r with the targeted player.\n$bullet;Damage |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297831|h[Potent Spark]|h|rs so that they expire at least 5 seconds apart to avoid lethal damage when they explode.\n$bullet;Positioning is important, especially during the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:303227|h[Form Ranks]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:297656|h[Stand Alone]|h|r decrees."},
			{id=20269,title="Section 25"},
			{id=20399,title="Section 32"},
			{id=20287,title="Queen Azshara"},
			{id=20176,title="Decrees",body="Throughout the fight, Queen Azshara enacts various decrees that must be dealt with. On higher difficulties, the amount of downtime between decrees is reduced."},
			{id=20177,title="Section 2"},
			{id=20241,title="Section 24"},
			{id=20186,title="Section 11"},
