			{itemID=170094,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=170088,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=20377,title="Overview",body="Ulmath is a powerful Merciless One with ultimate control of two minions, Moon Priestess Liara and Guardian Tannin."},
			{id=20378,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Reposition targets to mitigate incidental damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301840|h[Void Dance]|h|r.\n$bullet;Keep Ulmath's minions within $301657s3 yards of Ulmath to avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301657|h[Soul Tether]|h|r.\n$bullet;Avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301840|h[Void Dance]|h|r and flee from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301774|h[Mental Collapse]|h|r."},
			{id=20379,title="Healers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:301840|h[Void Dance]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301774|h[Mental Collapse]|h|r can cause significant, avoidable raid damage.\n$bullet;Avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301840|h[Void Dance]|h|r and flee from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301774|h[Mental Collapse]|h|r."},
			{id=20380,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:301653|h[Forlorn Fate]|h|r causes Ulmath and his minions to share damage taken.\n$bullet;Avoid |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301840|h[Void Dance]|h|r and flee from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:301774|h[Mental Collapse]|h|r."},
			{id=20386,title="Section 10"},
