			{itemID=174279,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=174447,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=20523,title="Overview",body="Ra-den periodically draws Void and Vita Essence from other realms. Essences that reach Ra-den empower him with energy of that type.\n\nAt 40% health, Ra-den begins drawling energy directly from these realms. This allows Ra-den to cast spells empowered by both energy types."},
			{id=20524,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;Position yourself to avoid unnecessary damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:306257|h[Unstable Vita]|h|r.\n$bullet;Position yourself to avoid chaining damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:306874|h[Chain Lightning]|h|r."},
			{id=20525,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Position yourself to avoid unnecessary damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:306257|h[Unstable Vita]|h|r.\n$bullet;Prioritize healing on targets affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:306184|h[Unleashed Void]|h|r.\n$bullet;Position yourself to avoid chaining damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:306874|h[Chain Lightning]|h|r."},
			{id=20526,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;Monitor Ra-den's energy to anticipate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:313213|h[Decaying Strike]|h|r timing.\n$bullet;Position Ra-den to avoid unnecessary damage from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:306257|h[Unstable Vita]|h|r."},
			{id=20527,title="Stage One: Gathering Power"},
