			{id=20553,title="Stage Two: Obsidian Statue",body="Maut protects itself with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:306005|h[Obsidian Skin]|h|r and prepares to destroy its enemies with |cFF2959D3|Hspell:305722|h[Obsidian Shatter]|h|r.\n\nMaut transforms again when the mana shield is broken or its cast of Obsidian Shatter completes."},
