			{itemID=173946,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=174532,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=20741,title="Overview",body="Drest'agath's appendages burst through the floor and attack enemies who enter her lair. When appendages are destroyed, pools of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:308377|h[Void Infused Ichor]|h|r form around their corpse. Enemies who touch |cFF2959D3|Hspell:308377|h[Void Infused Ichor]|h|r bypass the continual healing provided by Drest'agath's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:308373|h[Aberrant Regeneration]|h|r.\n\nIn addition to creating pools of |cFF2959D3|Hspell:308377|h[Void Infused Ichor]|h|r, destroying a tentacle partially fills Drest'agath's Agony bar. Upon reaching 100 Agony, Drest'agath begins |cFF2959D3|Hspell:308947|h[Throes of Agony]|h|r."},
			{id=20742,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet;All damage dealt to Drest'agath while not affected by |cFF2959D3|Hspell:308377|h[Void Infused Ichor]|h|r will be regenerated.\n$bullet;Destroying appendages can trigger |cFF2959D3|Hspell:308947|h[Throes of Agony]|h|r.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:310406|h[Void Glare]|h|r, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:310329|h[Entropic Crash]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:310358|h[Mutterings of Insanity]|h|r are each increased in power based on how many of each type of appendage is active."},
			{id=20743,title="Healers",body="$bullet;Be aware of which allies are inside |cFF2959D3|Hspell:310499|h[Obscuring Cloud]|h|r, as it will block line of sight in and out of the cloud.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:308947|h[Throes of Agony]|h|r can cause substantial damage to all players.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:310406|h[Void Glare]|h|r, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:310329|h[Entropic Crash]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:310358|h[Mutterings of Insanity]|h|r are each increased in power based on who many of each type of appendage is active."},
			{id=20744,title="Tanks",body="$bullet;If left alone, Drest'agath will begin using |cFF2959D3|Hspell:310246|h[Void Grip]|h|r on random allies.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:310277|h[Volatile Seed]|h|r can be used to apply |cFF2959D3|Hspell:312595|h[Volatile Corruption]|h|r to her appendages.\n$bullet;|cFF2959D3|Hspell:310406|h[Void Glare]|h|r, |cFF2959D3|Hspell:310329|h[Entropic Crash]|h|r and |cFF2959D3|Hspell:310358|h[Mutterings of Insanity]|h|r are each increased in power based on who many of each type of appendage is active."},
			{id=20745,title="Drest'agath"},
