		instanceID=1180,
		order=4,
		name="Dark Inquisitor Xanesh",
		lore="Few can resist the whispers of the Old Gods, but those who do find themselves at the \"mercy\" of Dark Inquisitor Xanesh. A cruel and sadistic torturer, Xanesh prides herself on slowly carving the sanity away from those in her charge until all that remains is unwavering devotion to N'Zoth.",
