			{itemID=174169,diffs={},faction=-1},
			{itemID=172190,diffs={},faction=-1},
		},
		sections={
			{id=20776,title="Overview",body="Xanesh summons power from the Void to torment players and Queen Azshara. Participate in Xanesh's |cFF2959D3|Hspell:312336|h[Void Ritual]|h|r to gain the ability to eliminate |cFF2959D3|Hspell:314202|h[Void Orbs]|h|r summoned during the encounter."},
			{id=20777,title="Tanks",body="$bullet; Position Xanesh so that allies can safely participate in |cFF2959D3|Hspell:312336|h[Void Ritual]|h|r.\n$bullet; During |cFF2959D3|Hspell:312336|h[Void Ritual]|h|r coordinate with allies that are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:309569|h[Voidwoken]|h|r to safely eliminate the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:314202|h[Void Orb]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:311551|h[Abyssal Strike]|h|r inflicts significant damage."},
			{id=20778,title="Healers",body="$bullet; During |cFF2959D3|Hspell:312336|h[Void Ritual]|h|r coordinate with allies that are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:309569|h[Voidwoken]|h|r to safely eliminate the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:314202|h[Void Orb]|h|r.\n$bullet; Move away from your soul to reduce damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:306228|h[Soul Flay]|h|r.\n$bullet; |cFF2959D3|Hspell:305792|h[Anguish]|h|r causes damage to all players throughout the encounter."},
			{id=20779,title="Damage Dealers",body="$bullet; During |cFF2959D3|Hspell:312336|h[Void Ritual]|h|r coordinate with allies that are |cFF2959D3|Hspell:309569|h[Voidwoken]|h|r to safely eliminate the |cFF2959D3|Hspell:314202|h[Void Orb]|h|r.\n$bullet; Move away from your soul to reduce damage taken from |cFF2959D3|Hspell:306228|h[Soul Flay]|h|r."},
			{id=20786,title="Dark Inquisitor Xanesh"},
			{id=20788,title="Section 22"},
			{id=20862,title="Section 11",body="$[!15\n\nIn Heroic difficulty, Voidwoken players are afflicted with Void-Touched when the Void Orb is eliminated.$]$[!16\n\nIn Mythic difficulty,Voidwoken players are afflicted with Void-Touched when the Void Orb is eliminated.$]"},
			{id=21047,title="Section 17",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=21111,title="Section 20",body="$[!15\n\nIn Heroic difficulty, when a Voidwoken player comes into contact with a Void Orb they trigger Imminent Doom.$]$[!16\n\nIn Mythic difficulty, when a Voidwoken player comes into contact with a Void Orb they trigger Imminent Doom and summon an Awakened Terror.$]"},
			{id=21227,title="Awakened Terror",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=21228,title="Section 24",difficultyIDs={16}},
			{id=21112,title="Section 21",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=21113,title="Section 22",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=20863,title="Section 12"},
			{id=21043,title="Section 15"},
			{id=21044,title="Section 16"},
			{id=21110,title="Section 19"},
			{id=20801,title="Section 11",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=21102,title="Section 18",difficultyIDs={15,16}},
			{id=20867,title="Section 14"},
			{id=20787,title="Section 10"},
			{id=20864,title="Queen Azshara"},
